:: Office Assignment Start
<<effects>>

<<if Time.hour gte 6 and Time.hour lte 21>>
	<<set $officeFloor to random(4,15)>>
	<<rng>>

	<<if $rng gte 86>>
		당신은 <<checkfloor>>에 있는 직원들에게 커피를 배달하는 임무를 맡는다.
		<<acceptassignment "Office Coffee Start">>
	<<elseif $rng gte 71>>
		당신은 <<checkfloor>>에서 열리는 회의의 필기를 맡는 임무를 맡는다.
		<<acceptassignment "Office Meeting Start">>
	<<elseif $rng gte 56>>
		당신은 <<checkfloor>>에서 일부 문서를 파기하는 임무를 맡는다.
		<<acceptassignment "Office Shredder Start">>
	<<elseif $rng gte 41>>
		당신은 <<checkfloor>>에서 임원을 보조하는 임무를 맡는다.
		<<acceptassignment "Office Executive Start">>
	<<elseif $rng gte 26>>
		당신은 <<checkfloor>>에서 문서를 정리하는 임무를 맡는다.
		<<acceptassignment "Office Filing Start">>
	<<else>>
		당신은 <<checkfloor>>에서 비서를 교대해주는 임무를 맡는다.
		<<acceptassignment "Office Secretary Start">>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	경비원이 휴게실에 들어와 모두를 로비로 안내한다. 건물이 일반인에게 폐쇄된다.
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[로비로 돌아가기 (0:01)|Office Lobby]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: Widgets Office Assignment [widget]
<<widget "acceptassignment">>
	<<set _assignment to _args[0]>>
	<br><br>
	이 임무를 수락하시겠습니까?
	<br><br>
	<<link [[네|_assignment]]>><<set $daily.officeHoursWorked to ($daily.officeHoursWorked or 0) + 1>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[다음 임무를 기다린다 (0:10)|Office Assignment Start]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[로비로 돌아가기 (0:01)|Office Lobby]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
<</widget>>

<<widget "completeassignment">>
	<<if _args[0] is undefined>>
		<<set $assignmentTime to 60>>
	<<else>>
		<<set $assignmentTime to _args[0]>>
	<</if>>
	<br>
	<<set _assignmentPay to (625 * ($assignmentTime / 60))>>
	<<if _assignmentPay gt 0>>
		<<managerLove 1>>
		임시 직원 휴게실로 돌아가 급여로 <span class="gold"><<printmoney _assignmentPay>></span>【을를】 받는다. <<money _assignmentPay>>
		<<if $managerLove gte random(50,100)>>
			<<set _managerTip to $managerLove * 20>><!-- £20 at 100 love-->
			<span class="green"><<office_manager>>【이가】 당신에게 <<printmoney _managerTip>>의 보너스를 준다.</span> <<money _managerTip>>
		<</if>>
		<<gperlove "manager">>
		<br><br>
	<</if>>
	<<set $officeFloor to 0>>
	<<timeTrackingManual "office" $assignmentTime "minute">>
	<<link [[파견 사무소|Office Agency]]>><<endevent>><<pass $assignmentTime>><</link>>
<</widget>>

<<widget "assignmenttip">>
	<<set $baseTip to _args[0]*100>>
	<<set $tipMod to (1 + $officeFloor * .075)>>
	<<set $tip to ($baseTip * $tipMod)>>
	<<if $mathstrait gte 1>>
		<<set $tip *= (1 + ($mathstrait / 4))>>
	<</if>>
	<<if $tip lte 0>>
		<<set $tip to 0>>
	<</if>>
	<<tipreceive>>
<</widget>>
